  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MIREME-NVE institutional cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An institutional cooperation program set up to improve energy sector management and assure transparent decision making processes in the energy sector in Mozambique. The Norwegian Water Resources and Energy Directorate (NVE) will work to strengthen institutional and human capacities in the Mozambican Ministry of Mineral Resources and Energy (MIREME). There are four areas of cooperation: i) analytical capacity ii) legal framework iii) capacity in the regulator iv) improved skills for efficiency.</narrative>
  </description>
